## 2. ACRE2 Project Exception

The copyright holder grants additional rights to qualifying ACRE2 Project Maintainers under:

`ACRE2_PROJECT_EXCEPTION.md`

That exception permits qualifying ACRE2 Project Maintainers to create public forks and distribute modified releases under its stated conditions.

The exception does not apply to the general public.

## 3. Material covered

Subject to ownership and the exclusions below, this licence applies to original UKSF AN/PRC-163 material supplied with the project, including original:

- SQF source code;
- configuration source;
- documentation;
- user-interface layouts and artwork;
- models and textures;
- icons;
- sounds;
- packaging and build files.

A file is covered only to the extent that UKSF Surplus owns or controls the copyright and has authority to license it.

